{"suttaId":"thi-ap37","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[10460,10506],"vripara":"168"},"segments":{"thi-ap37:0.3":"Aḍḍhakāsitherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap37:1.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","thi-ap37:1.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap37:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ pabbajitvāna, tassa buddhassa sāsane;","thi-ap37:2.3":"Saṃvutā pātimokkhamhi, indriyesu ca pañcasu.","thi-ap37:3.1":"“Mattaññunī ca asane, yuttā jāgariyepi ca;","thi-ap37:3.3":"Vasantī yuttayogāhaṃ, bhikkhuniṃ vigatāsavaṃ.","thi-ap37:4.1":"“Akkosiṃ duṭṭhacittāhaṃ, gaṇiketi bhaṇiṃ tadā;","thi-ap37:4.3":"Tena pāpena kammena, nirayamhi apaccisaṃ.","thi-ap37:5.1":"“Tena kammāvasesena, ajāyiṃ gaṇikākule;","thi-ap37:5.3":"Bahusova parādhīnā, pacchimāya ca jātiyaṃ.","thi-ap37:6.1":"“Kāsīsu seṭṭhikulajā, brahmacārībalenahaṃ;","thi-ap37:6.3":"Accharā viya devesu, ahosiṃ rūpasampadā.","thi-ap37:7.1":"“Disvāna dassanīyaṃ maṃ, giribbajapuruttame;","thi-ap37:7.3":"Gaṇikatte nivesesuṃ, akkosanabalena me.","thi-ap37:8.1":"“Sāhaṃ sutvāna saddhammaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhena desitaṃ;","thi-ap37:8.3":"Pubbavāsanasampannā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap37:9.1":"“Tadūpasampadatthāya, gacchantī jinasantikaṃ;","thi-ap37:9.3":"Magge dhutte ṭhite sutvā, labhiṃ dūtopasampadaṃ.","thi-ap37:10.1":"“Sabbakammaṃ parikkhīṇaṃ, puññaṃ pāpaṃ tatheva ca;","thi-ap37:10.3":"Sabbasaṃsāramuttiṇṇā, gaṇikattañca khepitaṃ.","thi-ap37:11.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap37:11.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmune.","thi-ap37:12.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap37:12.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap37:13.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap37:13.3":"Ñāṇaṃ mama mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap37:14.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap37:15.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap37:16.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap37:17.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ aḍḍhakāsi bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap37:18.1":"Aḍḍhakāsitheriyāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
